1
00:00:03,154 --> 00:00:08,650
Want to learn German — from your very first word, all the way to fluent? Meet DeutschWeg.

2
00:00:09,516 --> 00:00:16,668
Every student gets a personal account. Progress, scores and study time are saved automatically, on any device.

3
00:00:16,922 --> 00:00:21,938
The learning path covers every level, from A1 to C2: thirty-seven

4
00:00:21,938 --> 00:00:26,954
units with clear grammar, useful vocabulary, and lots of fun exercises.

5
00:00:28,025 --> 00:00:32,825
Daily goals, streaks and XP keep you motivated, every single day.

6
00:00:33,848 --> 00:00:40,472
Complete beginners start with the alphabet. Every letter and every word is spoken by a natural German voice.

7
00:00:51,786 --> 00:00:56,334
In the coursebook companion, you follow a story with recurring characters. Listen to

8
00:00:56,334 --> 00:01:00,882
each dialog: in a café, at the doctor, or in the city.

9
00:01:13,656 --> 00:01:17,436
Under every sentence there is an easy pronunciation guide, with tips

10
00:01:17,436 --> 00:01:21,216
for tricky sounds like ü, ch, and the German r.

11
00:01:21,470 --> 00:01:26,222
Then it's your turn: choose a character, and play the role yourself with your microphone.

12
00:01:28,135 --> 00:01:32,959
Each unit comes with interactive exercises: multiple choice, gap filling, sentence

13
00:01:32,959 --> 00:01:37,783
building, listening and speaking. Beginners get a word bank and hints.

14
00:01:42,077 --> 00:01:46,157
Every answer is checked instantly, and you hear the correct sentence.

15
00:01:52,545 --> 00:02:00,873
Endless drills train the hardest parts of German: der, die, das, verb forms, adjective endings and numbers.

16
00:02:06,495 --> 00:02:10,227
In the speaking lab, you shadow native sentences, practise timed

17
00:02:10,227 --> 00:02:13,959
exam tasks, and even talk with an A.I. conversation partner.

18
00:02:15,647 --> 00:02:19,307
The writing lab uses real exam formats, with a timer,

19
00:02:19,307 --> 00:02:22,967
a phrase bank, live checks, and optional A.I. correction.

20
00:02:24,318 --> 00:02:29,238
The Test Center has more than five thousand questions from A1 to C2 —

21
00:02:29,238 --> 00:02:34,158
listening, reading, vocabulary and grammar — plus a placement test that finds your level.

22
00:02:43,951 --> 00:02:47,431
Your statistics show how many minutes you study each day,

23
00:02:47,431 --> 00:02:50,911
your progress on every level, and all your test results.

24
00:02:59,017 --> 00:03:06,217
And teachers get an admin dashboard: every student's study time, streak, units and test scores, at a glance.

25
00:03:07,177 --> 00:03:12,289
DeutschWeg. Learn German step by step, and have fun doing it. Viel Spaß!
